OL,3,GNEWSA'River is flowing better than it
OL,4,Ahas for 25 years'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA river is flowing better than it has
OL,7,Ffor a quarter of a century after a
OL,8,Fmajor restoration but the next stage of
OL,9,Fworks will be "really critical",
OL,10,Faccording to a parish councillor.
OL,12,FWater levels in the River Deben in
OL,13,FSuffolk dropped by more than a metre
OL,14,Fafter heavy rain caused a weir
OL,15,Fstructure at Ufford, near Woodbridge,
OL,16,Fto fall away and a bridge to partially
OL,17,Fcollapse.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
