OL,3,GNEWSA'River is flowing better than it
OL,4,Ahas for 25 years'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile they are still to be fixed, water
OL,7,Fin the river is again running freely
OL,8,Fafter a multi-agency and community
OL,9,Feffort saw vital excavations and tree
OL,10,Fremoval take place.
OL,12,FCouncillor David Findley, river warden
OL,13,Fat Ufford Parish Council, said it was a
OL,14,F"really exciting moment to actually see
OL,15,Fthe water flowing" again.
